    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong start, especially the spatial aspect. I want to lean more into the \"visceral\" part for the Low-Tier characters. When you're describing them in the prose, I want the reader to feel a gut level of distinction. Can you get more specific about their physical features? Like, how would their skin, facial features, or even the way they carry themselves look compared to the High-Tiers to really drive home that they are a different, lower class?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
